1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:08,910
MediClaro is the app that explains your medicines clearly. Here's how it works, from start to finish.

2
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:16,809
No sign-up needed. When you open the app, tap “Discover MediClaro” to see everything it can do for you.

3
00:00:17,079 --> 00:00:22,865
A four-step guided tour, with voice, shows you how to identify your medicines…

4
00:00:23,135 --> 00:00:25,505
…how to ask the assistant…

5
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:28,179
…how to listen to the leaflet…

6
00:00:28,449 --> 00:00:34,642
…and how it helps you in an emergency. If you already know the app, you can skip it.

7
00:00:34,912 --> 00:00:41,879
Choose your plan: monthly, quarterly or yearly. No commitment: cancel whenever you like.

8
00:00:42,149 --> 00:00:47,518
Pay with Apple or Google Play, using your phone's official payment sheet…

9
00:00:47,788 --> 00:00:54,665
…or by card, on Stripe's secure page. MediClaro never sees or stores your card.

10
00:00:54,935 --> 00:00:59,929
As soon as the payment is confirmed, Premium is active right away.

11
00:01:00,199 --> 00:01:05,817
Then add your phone number, so you won't lose your subscription if you change phones.

12
00:01:06,087 --> 00:01:09,151
You'll receive a code by text message.

13
00:01:09,421 --> 00:01:14,081
Type it in with the large keypad, and that's it: you're in.

14
00:01:14,351 --> 00:01:22,923
This is your home screen. Everything is one tap away: identify, your medicines, the assistant and emergency.

15
00:01:23,193 --> 00:01:27,989
To find out what a medicine is, just take a photo of the box.

16
00:01:28,259 --> 00:01:30,910
You can also scan the barcode…

17
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:35,071
…or type in the national code printed on the box.

18
00:01:35,341 --> 00:01:41,616
MediClaro looks it up in the official database of the Spanish Agency of Medicines.

19
00:01:41,886 --> 00:01:45,781
Within seconds, it tells you what the medicine is.

20
00:01:46,051 --> 00:01:50,593
And it explains it in plain words: what it is, what it's for…

21
00:01:50,863 --> 00:01:54,852
…how to take it, and what precautions to keep in mind.

22
00:01:55,122 --> 00:02:02,014
If you want more detail, the full official leaflet is right there, with its source and date.

23
00:02:02,284 --> 00:02:09,975
Is the print too small? Tap “Read aloud” and MediClaro reads it to you, at the speed you prefer.

24
00:02:10,245 --> 00:02:18,842
Before using artificial intelligence, the app asks for your permission. You decide, and you can withdraw it at any time.

25
00:02:19,112 --> 00:02:26,664
Ask whatever you need, in your own words. The assistant answers clearly, citing the official source…

26
00:02:26,934 --> 00:02:31,502
…and always reminds you to check with your doctor or pharmacist.

27
00:02:31,772 --> 00:02:38,713
If it detects an emergency, it shows you the 112 emergency number right away.

28
00:02:38,983 --> 00:02:43,137
Save your medicines to your list and mark your favourites.

29
00:02:43,407 --> 00:02:49,318
From each one you can open its details, listen to it, or ask the assistant.

30
00:02:49,588 --> 00:02:54,072
Your history shows everything you've looked up, day by day.

31
00:02:54,342 --> 00:03:01,845
In an emergency, 112 is always in view: with or without a subscription, and without signing up.

32
00:03:02,115 --> 00:03:06,491
The emergency assistant asks whether you're able to speak…

33
00:03:06,761 --> 00:03:10,403
…and helps you say what's wrong, with a single tap.

34
00:03:10,673 --> 00:03:17,560
Then it prepares your information: where you are, your details, your medicines and your contact.

35
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:25,985
You can call your assistance service or 112. The app opens the phone dialer; it never calls on its own.

36
00:03:26,255 --> 00:03:32,702
During the call, your information and a ready-made message for the operator are at hand.

37
00:03:32,972 --> 00:03:38,948
And with one tap you can alert a family member, with a message that's already written.

38
00:03:39,218 --> 00:03:44,754
All of this comes from your emergency profile, which you fill in just once…

39
00:03:45,024 --> 00:03:48,028
…and where you decide what gets shared.

40
00:03:48,298 --> 00:03:52,026
In your profile, you adjust the app to suit you.

41
00:03:52,296 --> 00:03:58,791
Normal, large or extra-large text; high contrast; and the speed of the voice.

42
00:03:59,061 --> 00:04:03,589
Easy Mode keeps only the essentials, with bigger buttons.

43
00:04:03,859 --> 00:04:11,453
Your data is yours: download it whenever you want, withdraw the AI permission, or delete your account.

44
00:04:11,723 --> 00:04:17,573
And your subscription is managed from the app store itself, with no hassle.

45
00:04:17,843 --> 00:04:23,063
MediClaro. Your medicines, clearly explained.

46
00:04:23,333 --> 00:04:30,545
MediClaro informs; it does not replace your doctor or pharmacist.
